-> Test: `Length` is a compiled-in core handler, not a function call.
-> `emit X to core get result` — Code has no user-defined functions.

emit Length { value = [1, 2, 3, 4] } to core get n1
assert n1._class = "LengthResult"
assert n1.value = 4

emit Length { value = "hello world" } to core get n2
assert n2.value = 11

emit Length { value = [] } to core get n3
assert n3.value = 0
